### Member get my profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/members/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Member update my profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/members/me
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

